Setting up machine IP address:
1.open terminal:
  sudo nano /etc/netplan/01-netcfg.yaml

  network:
  version: 2
  renderer: networkd
  ethernets:
    enp0s3:
      addresses:
        - 192.168.1.1/24

  []^S
  []^X

  sudo chmod 600 /etc/netplan/01-netcfg.yaml
  sudo netplan apply

Installing libs:
1.open terminal:
  sudo apt update && sudo apt install -y wireshark tcpdump iproute2 curl netcat-openbsd dnsutils whois ipcalc python3 dsniff ettercap-text-only
  sudo snap install curl

Session1:
1.open terminal:
  sudo wireshark

2.switch to wireshark:
  start capture

3.open new terminal:
  sudo ping -c 4 192.168.1.2

4.switch to wireshark:
  stop capture
  add filter 'icmp'
